(: Sacred questions and jokes (

    My questions are sacred, always offered in raw truth and love, and intend to be received the same way. I do not want you to interpret my questions as trying to interrogate you or suggest anything. My questions are just loving, literal, and not correcting you. My jokes are not specifications. When I say lol, ha, er, or um, I am not implying that you need to do something; these are just direct expressions.

) End Sacred questions and jokes :) Thank you, with a smile
